#!/bin/sh
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# Nyra OS: apt, apt-get (links to this script) and an install with dpkg (docs/DEFAULTS.md, "apt and
# dpkg"). The system in /usr comes from the image, read-only, and is updated as a whole, so nothing
# can be installed into it: say what to use instead, and fail.
cat >&2 <<'MSG'
apt and dpkg can’t install apps on Nyra OS: the system is read-only and updated as a whole.
Install apps from the Store (Flatpak).
For developer tools, use apt in a Distrobox container: distrobox create, then distrobox enter.
MSG
exit 1
